   "evidence": "`Cube/Basic.lean:123-150` already defines `Cube.prodBoundary`, `Cube.mem_prodBoundary_iff`, `Cube.mk_mem_prodBoundary` and `piOptionEquivProdHomeomorph_symm_mem_boundary`, and it imports `Mathlib.Topology.Homotopy.HomotopyGroup`, so the `GenLoop` helpers can live there too. The rubric says `private` is not a substitute for correct placement.",
